android/app/src/main/java/org/tensorflow/lite/examples/detection/tflite/TFLiteObjectDetectionAPIModel.java
specifies RGB float channels (channel - 128) / 128 and a 192-float output.
Phone Robot checks [1,112,112,3] FLOAT32 input and [1,192] FLOAT32 output at runtime.
It crops frontal faces, resizes to 112x112, and L2-normalizes embeddings for cosine matching.

