RUNTIME LIMITATIONS
Face matching is an uncalibrated convenience feature, not security authentication.
Photographs can spoof it; there is no liveness detection. Lighting, pose, aging,
camera quality and demographic bias can cause false matches or missed matches.
Cosine similarity must be at least 0.75 with a 0.10 margin over the next identity;
these conservative starting values are not measured accuracy guarantees.
Enrollment needs one sole frontal face at least 100x100 pixels, fully in frame,
and a recent completed inference. Bounding boxes are not landmark-aligned.
Only names and embeddings are stored in app-private no-backup storage; no photos
are persisted or uploaded. Logical deletion rewrites the store; physical erasure
of flash blocks cannot be guaranteed by an Android application.
ML Kit face detection is bundled through com.google.mlkit:face-detection:16.1.7;
its separate vendor terms apply. Camera and ML inference performance must be
measured on the target Huawei Mate 10 Lite.
